.25 faults, which won him the gold medal individually and brought Mexico the team gold as well."] "\n\n" [:p {} "There was a three-way tie for second, with 8.00 faults, among Mariles’ teammate " [:a {:href "/athletes/12886"} "Rubén Uriza"] ", France’s " [:a {:href "/athletes/11894"} "Jean, Marquis d’Orgeix"] ", and American " [:a {:href "/athletes/13009"} "Franklin Wing"] ", which required a jump-off. Uriza won the silver medal in the jump-off with the only clean round of the event, while Wing and Marquis d’Orgeix both had 4.00 faults. The bronze medal went to Marquis d’Orgeix as he had the faster time in the jump-off, 38.9 to 40.1 seconds."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "Horse"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Faults"] [:th {} "Jump Faults"] [:th {} "Time Faults"] [:th {} "Time"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/12371"} "Humberto Mariles"]] [:td {} [:i {} [:a {:href "/horses/139"} "Arete"]]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/MEX"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/MEX.png"}] "MEX"]] [:td {} "6.25"] [:td {} "4"] [:td {} "2.25"] [:td {} "2:18.1"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/12886"} "Rubén Uriza"]] [:td {} [:i {} [:a {:href "/horses/1110"} "Harvey"]]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/MEX"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/MEX.png"}] "MEX"]] [:td {} "8.00"] [:td {} "8"] [:td {} "0.00"] [:td {} "1:58.0"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/11894"} "Jean, Marquis d'Orgeix"]] [:td {} [:i {} [:a {:href "/horses/2380"} "Sucre de Pomme"]]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countr